  "steps": [
    "Wash the dal and pressure-cook it with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for 4 whistles until very soft; whisk until smooth.",
    "Pour the whisked dal into a pot, add 1 more cup of hot water and bring to a gentle boil.",
    "Add the chopped tomato, kokum, jaggery and peanuts, and simmer for 10 minutes until the peanuts soften.",
    "In a small pan heat the oil and crackle the mustard seeds and cumin seeds.",
    "Add curry leaves, green chilli and ginger paste, stir for 20 seconds, then add the chilli powder and pour the tempering over the dal.",
    "Simmer for 5 more minutes, adjusting jaggery and salt until sweet, sour and spicy are in balance, and finish with coriander."
  ]
